              <span id="map-loc-type" style="font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary-orange); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;">Corporate HQ &amp; Processing Plant</span>
